review:
I've been in love with this game ever since the early releases. I read every patchnotes and keep up to date with changes even though I rarely play it since I have all the achievements. This is a go to game when wanting to relax and grow a business. One of the games I come back to time to time again even with 100% completion. I had a bug which I reported through email and was fixed a few updates later, which really speaks for how the developers care about the game. 

TLDR;
buy this game it's good
